Installation and Setup into your laptops
=======================================================
mkdir Fastapi
cd Fastapi

create Virtual Environment
===============================
python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
pip install fastapi
pip install uvicorn  [for web server ]


Source Code
================
from fastapi import FastAPI

app = FastAPI()
@app.get("/")
def home():
    return {"name":"siddhu"}

